    "A link to somewhere else:  pokemon.forms, pokemon.location_area_encounters, pokemon_species.growth_rate, pokemon_species.egg_groups, pokemon_species.color, pokemon_species.shape, pokemon_species.habitat, types.move_damage_class, moves.contest_type, moves.contest_effect, moves.damage_class, moves.super_contest_effect, moves.target, generations.main_region, generations.version_groups hold addresses of nothing described here, so they read as text.",
